+provides the reference for the message lifecycle. Surface's optional
+`SnackbarMotion` tracks the displayed fraction of one message. Call `advance`
+on host animation frames and use `progress` to position its view. Rebuild as
+soon as the app dismisses the message. Call `without_interaction` with the
+optional focus target on any view kept for exit paint. Remove that view when
+`should_mount(false)` returns false. A replacement message starts its own
+track. The Gallery slides the message from and toward the lower edge and
+settles immediately with Reduce Motion.
 
